  "description": "Ines, an illegitimate daughter who spent her whole life repressing herself, has loved her friend Lucien since childhood. However, Ines is also trapped in a miserable life where she must regularly deal with Lucien’s \"curse\" that drives him into a state of lust that Lucien himself cannot remember. Unloved, disrespected, and unable to rely on anybody else, Ines decides she has had enough. On the verge of being married off to a stranger, she decides to flee and start over. However, she is intent on stealing one victory before she leaves: bearing Lucien’s child.\n\n**Original Novel:**    \n[Chapters](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=12967485), [Volumes](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=13617797) \n\n**Official Translations:**    \nR15: [English](https://www.tappytoon.com/en/book/love-you-to-tears)  \nR19: [English](https://www.tappytoon.com/en/book/love-you-to-tears-m)",
